                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.60i31/103: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Estonia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Leonard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-05-20T13:00:00-04:00">May 20, 1938—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10. Your no. 13, May 14, noon. Note of Estonian Foreign Office of May 14 and your
                    acknowledgment thereof are acceptable.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
